Log the cause when Library Management cannot resolve or read a file at preview.

Why: the planner's path and read step maps its error to FILE_UNREADABLE (or a
symlink/root reason) without logging it, unlike the tag steps right after it
("tags unreadable at preview"). Correction 2026-10-24: the 10 FILE_UNREADABLE
files of that day's dry run came from the tag step (the picture reader, see
0009), which did log; the earlier search missed those lines. This patch only
closes the gap in the step before it.

Tests: none (a log line); cargo check -p droppedneedle-library.

Remove when: upstream logs it.

